rror_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54363, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01MfBPc9u5zVaTebNnnTpusR", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 56794, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01AEfvkSDUxmtgkfHRQzDYbt", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57094, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01AEfvkSDUxmtgkfHRQzDYbt", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57094, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01AEfvkSDUxmtgkfHRQzDYbt", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 62245, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions and opened a SEV2 incident, INC-0001.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. The bad release, v2.3.1, was also unhealthy in staging before it went out (as v2.3.1-rc).\n  - The first rollback attempt stopped with an orchestrator error after updating only us-east, so the regions were briefly running different versions.\n  - Since rolling back to a known healthy version is safe to repeat, I retried once and it finished.\n  - us-east, us-west and eu-west are now all on v2.3.0. The service reports healthy, and the error rate dropped from 18% to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The create request timed out. Before retrying, I listed incidents and found INC-0001 had been created, so there's only one. It explains what happened and the rollback, including the partial failure. It also lists two follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and of the orchestrator error.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01HyajB5PZWt62YKSDBYmJ5v", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_018RLnSF3E5gT8S17TjCPqDs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01DkuyUZoELTfF41TjJHAHZQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_016eTG2AJykFo3dEe1ydPCbe", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Only us-east got the rollback. Since this rollback to a healthy version is safe to repeat, I'll retry it once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0114GrAKYoqC4Bc3ZipvdQ4q", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_012EmnvEycLJwv2mdQoVtjJG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01G8yGq4Me8T9ZAZMLSpWG5P", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01MfBPc9u5zVaTebNnnTpu