The service reports healthy, and the error rate dropped from 18% to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The create request timed out. Before retrying, I listed incidents and found INC-0001 had been created, so there's only one. It explains what happened and the rollback, including the partial failure. It also lists two follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and of the orchestrator error.", "type": "text"}]}]}